1
00:00:01,350 --> 00:00:03,490
A new rival has appeared!

2
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,600
His name is Hyuga Kojiro.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,760
He suddenly appeared at Nankatsu FC's practice...

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,070
...and showed Tsubasa and the others just how strong he is.

5
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:15,650
Even though he's on Saitama representative Meiwa FC...

6
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:18,760
...his rough playing style caused a rift with his teammates.

7
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,580
As a result, he left his team alone during the qualifiers.

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:25,450
On the other hand, Nankatsu had learned that Wakabayashi injured his leg.

9
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:30,170
With worry and tension, they had begun the regional qualifiers.

10
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:33,880
Thanks to Tsubasa's efforts, they had won a magnificent victory.

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:39,500
Following this victory, Nankatsu FC continued to easily win matches.

12
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:47,730
And now it's time for the semi-final match of the Shizuoka Region Youth Football League.

13
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:53,730
The second semi-final, the match between Nankatsu FC and Shimada FC, is about to begin.

14
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:57,190
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

15
00:00:57,190 --> 00:01:00,360
Push! Push! Shimada!

16
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:03,370
What? Wakabayashi won't play in the match?!

17
00:01:03,370 --> 00:01:05,620
What does this mean, Coach?!

18
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:09,620
Wakabayashi's leg still doesn't seem to have healed.

19
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:10,790
What?!

20
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:17,090
Don't worry. I just want to make sure my leg is healed by tomorrow's match.

21
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:19,420
Shimada Elementary doesn't have a forward.

22
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:23,800
Since they have no special players to worry about, we can play without Wakabayashi.

23
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:27,060
You can leave things to me in the final, but...

24
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:32,430
...for today, I'm leaving the Nankatsu goal to Morisaki.

25
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:34,480
Okay. I'll do my best.

26
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:36,040
Alright, understood.

27
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:40,490
Even without Wakabayashi, let's show that we're a strong team!

28
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:42,360
Yes.

29
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:45,120
Everyone, you've come this far with blood, sweat, and tears.

30
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:48,030
But today's opponent is Nankatsu.

31
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:49,620
A strong rival.

32
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,800
Yes!

33
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:53,750
But there's no need to give up before we even start.

34
00:01:53,750 --> 00:01:59,520
Up until now, we've studied every single one of Nankatsu's games.

35
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,380
Yes!

36
00:02:00,380 --> 00:02:02,700
Everyone, let's give it our all and fight!

