Episode 11
An Unexpected Difficulty

62
00:03:33,690 --> 00:03:39,100
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

63
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:39,770
In the second match of the Shizuoka regional qualifiers semi-finals, Nankatsu FC and Shimada Elementary face off.

64
00:03:39,770 --> 00:03:43,940
Everyone's eyes are on Nankatsu FC to win the qualifiers.

65
00:03:44,390 --> 00:03:48,010
Thanks to attacks led by center forward Ozora Tsubasa-kun...

66
00:03:48,010 --> 00:03:53,080
...they average 9 goals per match and are the tournament's dominant force.

67
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:59,380
Additionally, prodigy goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun didn't concede a single goal across 6 consecutive matches.

68
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:03,380
However, due to a leg injury, Wakabayashi-kun will not play in this match.

69
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:08,260
In this match, Nankatsu's goal will be guarded by number 12, Morisaki Yuzo-kun.

70
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:11,100
Meanwhile, the Shimada Elementary Football Club...

71
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:15,560
...is a team that has come this far through determination and teamwork.

72
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:19,330
The first match of the semi-finals was won by the famous Shimizu FC...

73
00:04:19,330 --> 00:04:24,070
...featuring prodigy goalkeeper Kawakami-kun, who is compared to Wakabayashi-kun.

74
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:29,660
Will the winner advancing to the finals be Nankatsu or Shimada Elementary?

75
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:32,510
What? So these guys are Nankatsu, huh?

76
00:04:32,510 --> 00:04:35,050
Everyone looks really talented at football.

77
00:04:35,050 --> 00:04:36,750
Let's get along, please!

78
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,370
Let's be gentle!

79
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:40,300
W-What's wrong with them?

80
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:41,880
They have a weird mood.

81
00:04:44,130 --> 00:04:45,420
Hey!

82
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:49,430
You...

83
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:53,120
What? They don't seem that strong.

84
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,720
Hey, Izawa!

85
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,730
What are they doing?

86
00:04:57,730 --> 00:04:59,550
Aren't they going to attack?

87
00:04:59,550 --> 00:05:01,690
They're not trying to get the ball.

88
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:04,360
Seems like we'll win easily today.

89
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,280
Take that, Tsubasa!

90
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:09,200
Izawa-kun from Nankatsu sends a long pass to the forward line!

91
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,320
Alright!

92
00:05:11,090 --> 00:05:12,440
Intercepted!

93
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,990
Izawa-kun's long pass doesn't reach its destination.

94
00:05:14,990 --> 00:05:16,750
Nice interception, Fujisawa.

95
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:18,050
N-No way.

96
00:05:18,050 --> 00:05:19,750
Isn't it too obvious?

97
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:20,920
Here!

98
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,410
Fujisawa-kun, who got the ball...

99
00:05:22,410 --> 00:05:23,790
Oh no! Fall back!

100
00:05:22,410 --> 00:05:25,420
...sends a long pass to his teammate up front.

101
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:28,170
The ball reaches Shimada Elementary's captain, Nagasaki-kun.

102
00:05:28,170 --> 00:05:29,050
Damn it!

103
00:05:29,050 --> 00:05:32,760
Nankatsu's defense is caught before they can reorganize.

104
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,890
What are you doing, Morisaki?!

105
00:05:34,890 --> 00:05:37,020
You should have held the first line of defense!

106
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,310
Y-Yes.

107
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:40,720
All or nothing!

108
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,400
What?!

109
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:45,190
Nagasaki-kun unexpectedly fires a long shot!

110
00:05:45,190 --> 00:05:46,230
The goalkeeper can't reach it!

111
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,200
I-It went in.

112
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:54,330
How did Shimada find an opening?! I can't believe it!

113
00:05:54,330 --> 00:05:56,330
I did it! It's like a joke!

114
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:59,080
We managed to score against Nankatsu.

115
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:01,780
Hey! What are you doing, goalkeeper?!

116
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:04,560
You needed to stop that weak shot!

117
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,710
Anego!

118
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:08,280
Following a long pass and a quick counter-attack...

119
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:11,130
...a long shot from outside the penalty area finds the net.

120
00:06:11,130 --> 00:06:16,870
Nankatsu's 6-match streak of not conceding a goal comes to an end!

121
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:18,930
Nankatsu isn't that great after all.

122
00:06:21,350 --> 00:06:22,730
I'm sorry.

123
00:06:22,730 --> 00:06:25,130
Don't let it get you down, Morisaki.

124
00:06:25,130 --> 00:06:28,310
We've averaged 9 goals per match.

125
00:06:28,310 --> 00:06:30,780
We'll recover before you even realize it.

126
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:31,860
Everyone...

127
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:35,050
Did you think Nankatsu would lose in a place like this?

128
00:06:35,050 --> 00:06:36,990
Let's pull ourselves together and push!

129
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:40,210
Shizuoka regional semi-finals.

130
00:06:40,210 --> 00:06:43,250
Nankatsu FC and Shimada Elementary face off.

131
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:50,050
No one could have predicted this match would come to this state.

132
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,550
It looks like it might rain.

133
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:56,220
# Saitama Regional Semi-Finals #

134
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,300
The first half is ending.

135
00:06:56,300 --> 00:07:00,310
Nanbu FC leads by three goals.

136
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:02,390
That's it, we're doing great.

137
00:07:02,390 --> 00:07:03,460
We've got this match.

138
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,700
Impossible.

139
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:08,290
Going to the nationals without Hyuga-san...

140
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:10,780
Is this the extent of your caliber?

141
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,710
Hyuga-san!

142
00:07:12,710 --> 00:07:13,910
What's wrong?

143
00:07:13,910 --> 00:07:17,160
Weren't you going to win with your own football style?

144
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,380
Captain...

145
00:07:18,380 --> 00:07:22,010
Please don't say things like that and play in the match.

146
00:07:22,010 --> 00:07:23,120
Please!

147
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,830
Please!

148
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:26,210
Alright.

149
00:07:26,210 --> 00:07:29,800
But only if you play with my football style.

150
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:33,300
What? Hyuga-san's football?

151
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:34,680
Exactly.

152
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,970
My football is football that doesn't accept defeat!

153
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:39,970
Football ready to do anything to win!

154
00:07:39,970 --> 00:07:43,200
The time has come for the second half to begin.

155
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,980
Meiwa FC makes a player substitution.

156
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:51,320
Number 10 Hyuga-kun comes in for number 13 Nakamoto-kun.

157
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:53,610
What? Hyuga is coming in?

158
00:07:53,610 --> 00:07:56,360
Why now when he hasn't played in any matches so far?

159
00:07:56,850 --> 00:08:01,870
Number 15 Sawada-kun comes in for number 14 Koyama-kun.

160
00:08:01,870 --> 00:08:04,710
Finally, I'll be able to play with Hyuga-san.

161
00:08:04,710 --> 00:08:07,910
Captain! Takeshi is still in 4th grade.

162
00:08:07,910 --> 00:08:10,020
Why in this match?

163
00:08:10,020 --> 00:08:12,250
Watch the second half and figure it out yourselves.

164
00:08:12,250 --> 00:08:14,720
Takeshi is my valuable partner.

165
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:17,040
Let's go, Takeshi!

166
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,080
Okay!

167
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:22,880
The second half of the semi-final match between Meiwa FC and Nanbu FC, which will determine the Saitama regional representatives...

168
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:26,140
...is about to kick off!

169
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,360
Kisugi-kun shoots!

170
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:33,700
But the ball bounces off the post.

171
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:36,610
That's Nankatsu's 10th shot in the first half.

172
00:08:36,610 --> 00:08:37,900
Damn it!

173
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:41,550
Kisugi, why didn't you pass to Tsubasa who was in front of the goal?!

174
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:44,000
What does it matter?! I had a chance to shoot!

175
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,160
Look at the score and say that again!

176
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:49,450
We're losing by one goal!

177
00:08:50,910 --> 00:08:55,740
Considering ball possession and shot count, we're the superior side but...

178
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:58,050
...for some reason we still haven't scored even one goal.

179
00:08:58,050 --> 00:09:01,720
What are they doing?!

180
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:07,480
Shimada Elementary counters again with a long pass!

181
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,810
But Kishida-kun intercepts the ball!

182
00:09:12,830 --> 00:09:13,650
Hold him!

183
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:15,780
Alright, we'll score the goal this time!

184
00:09:15,780 --> 00:09:17,240
Everyone mark him!

185
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,030
Okay!

186
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:23,120
Against Nankatsu's terrifying attacks, Shimada Elementary is defending!

187
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:25,790
The defense repels with all its might!

188
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,830
He passes to Kisugi-kun.

189
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:29,890
Another long-range shot!

190
00:09:29,890 --> 00:09:32,840
But the ball is caught by the goalkeeper.

191
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:35,200
Is this the end of the road for Nankatsu?

192
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:38,780
They can't break through Shimada Elementary's defense and haven't scored a single goal!

193
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:41,010
Why aren't they passing to Tsubasa?!

194
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:44,760
The first half is coming to an end!

195
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:47,530
In the second match of the Shizuoka regional semi-finals...

196
00:09:47,530 --> 00:09:51,650
...the first half ends with Shimada Elementary leading 1-0.

197
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:56,400
The tournament favorite Nankatsu FC finished the first half goalless!

198
00:09:58,130 --> 00:10:00,360
What are you doing?

199
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:03,420
Your attack tempo is completely absent.

200
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:05,620
Why aren't you adapting to Tsubasa?

201
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:09,280
Because we can easily get past them by passing...

202
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:12,370
Once we beat the defense, we take our shot.

203
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:18,880
I understand how you feel, but the strongest player on this team is Tsubasa.

204
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:22,120
Pass more effectively and adapt to Tsubasa.

205
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:22,830
Understood?

206
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:23,680
Yes!

207
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:26,470
Coach, should I come in during the second half?

208
00:10:26,470 --> 00:10:27,360
What?

209
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,580
No, we'll continue like this.

210
00:10:29,580 --> 00:10:31,240
We're counting on you, Tsubasa.

211
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,040
Okay!

212
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:38,440
It's raining.

213
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:42,200
How many times have we witnessed a scene like this?

214
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:46,860
He gets past opponents one after another again and brings the ball to the line.

215
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:51,710
Number 15 Sawada Takeshi-kun is the youngest player participating in this tournament!

216
00:10:51,710 --> 00:10:54,210
Was Takeshi this good?

217
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,040
Hyuga-san!

218
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:01,800
Sawada-kun sends a cross to Hyuga-kun in front of the goal line!

219
00:11:02,410 --> 00:11:03,130
Exactly.

220
00:11:03,130 --> 00:11:05,640
Thanks to this duo that came in during the second half...

221
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:08,970
...Meiwa FC scored 3 goals and caught up to the opponent.

222
00:11:08,970 --> 00:11:10,970
Hyuga! Mark Hyuga!

223
00:11:10,970 --> 00:11:13,390
We can't let you score any more goals!

224
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,900
This is as far as you go!

225
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:20,280
Hyuga-kun shoots!

226
00:11:24,090 --> 00:11:26,140
The match ends.

227
00:11:26,140 --> 00:11:27,710
4-3!

228
00:11:27,710 --> 00:11:32,290
With a huge comeback, the team advancing to the Saitama regional final is Meiwa FC!

229
00:11:32,770 --> 00:11:35,640
What a terrifying forward!

230
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:40,910
This boy came in the second half, scored 4 goals, and carried his team to the lead.

231
00:11:40,910 --> 00:11:43,050
His name is Hyuga Kojiro-kun!

232
00:11:46,880 --> 00:11:48,930
Misaki-kun steals the ball!

233
00:11:48,930 --> 00:11:53,230
Nankatsu FC's attacks have slowed down in the second half!

234
00:11:53,230 --> 00:11:54,690
Hey, Misaki!

235
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:02,360
I don't know if it's because of the rain, but the players seem to be playing worse.

236
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,610
It seems like luck is smiling on us.

237
00:12:09,490 --> 00:12:11,410
What's wrong, everyone?

238
00:12:11,410 --> 00:12:14,190
Shimada Elementary's matches have always ended with close scores.

239
00:12:14,190 --> 00:12:18,330
Are they truly strong enough to stop us?

240
00:12:18,330 --> 00:12:22,170
Coach, can I look at the data on Shimada Elementary once more, please?

241
00:12:22,170 --> 00:12:23,120
Of course.

242
00:12:25,290 --> 00:12:26,930
Th-This...

243
00:12:26,930 --> 00:12:28,670
That's to be expected from Nankatsu!

244
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:32,010
Even on wet ground, their passes find their target.

245
00:12:32,010 --> 00:12:33,060
Alright!

246
00:12:34,060 --> 00:12:37,560
What?! The ball hit a puddle of water!

247
00:12:39,590 --> 00:12:41,500
It's true that all their matches ended with close scores but...

248
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:45,360
...Shimada Elementary also hasn't conceded any goals so far, just like us.

249
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:47,070
What did you say?

250
00:12:47,070 --> 00:12:50,780
They've allowed their opponents to take only a few shots in every match.

251
00:12:50,780 --> 00:12:53,650
Even then, the entire team protected the goal.

252
00:12:53,650 --> 00:12:58,040
When they got the ball, they gambled by sending long passes for counter-attacks.

253
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:01,710
They've come this far by winning this way.

254
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:03,750
So Shimada Elementary...

255
